id slowlang
name SlowLang
appeared 2025
creators Sebin Mathew, Abin Zachariah Abraham
tags esolang
aka TortoiseLang
website https://sebin-gg.github.io/slowlang/
githubRepo https://github.com/sebin-gg/slowlang
docs https://esolangs.org/wiki/SlowLang
fileType text
country India
description A Python-like esoteric language distributed with a Tkinter IDE and browser demo that enforces slow typing. Typing above 30 WPM triggers an angry ASCII turtle and haiku-formatted errors, and programs must call the please() builtin within every politeness window or the run is refused.

helloWorldCollection SlowLang
 Hello World in SlowLang
 
 please()
 print("Hello World")
 please()
